    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.RangeIndex.from_range#\n\n- \n*classmethod* RangeIndex.from_range(*data* ,*name=None* ,*dtype=None* )[source]#\n- Create `pandas.RangeIndex` from a`range` object.\n  - Returns:\n    - RangeIndex\n Examples >>> pd.RangeIndex.from_range(range(5)) RangeIndex(start=0, stop=5, step=1) >>> pd.RangeIndex.from_range(range(2, -10, -3)) RangeIndex(start=2, stop=-10, step=-3)",
